{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14231770","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14231770","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1423177001:0":{"text":"사실 해본 사람은 있었지. 하지만 완성품의 품질이 평범해서 깊은바위 수정에는 못 미쳤거든.","source_cn":"其实也有人试过，但是锻造出来的武器质量平平，肯定是比不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35F7975DD6CA90AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1423177002:1":{"text":"하지만 새로운 기술 덕분에 천청광으로 만든 모아 강철이 깊은바위 수정보다 훨씬 더 좋아!","source_cn":"这不是研究出了新方法，用天青矿锻打成的魔钢比深岩晶更胜一筹！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC5D9CB259728A6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423177003:1":{"text":"이제야 우리 마을에도 희망이 보여...","source_cn":"这下村子终于有希望了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3EE200016358629D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:监工特特里":{"text":"현장 감독 테테리","source":"监工特特里","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}